## Auditable scope map

The following existing project-owned files are also part of this separately
licensed NP2TEST component and carry the SPDX identifier where their syntax
permits it:

- `tests/guest/README.md`
- `tests/guest/protocol/result-v1.md`
- `tests/guest/np2test/Makefile`
- `tests/guest/np2test/layout.json`
- `tests/guest/np2test/reference-validation.md`
- `tests/guest/np2test/memory-map.md`
- `tests/guest/np2test/src/ipl.asm`
- `tests/guest/np2test/src/result.inc`
- `tests/guest/np2test/golden/np2test-fd1232.image`
- `tests/guest/np2test/golden/SHA256SUMS`
- `tools/guest/build_np2test.py`
- `tools/guest/verify_np2test.py`
- `tools/guest/test_np2test.py`

This is an explicit path list, not a license grant for all of `tests/guest/`
or `tools/guest/`. In particular, future `tests/guest/freedos98/` and
`tests/guest/elks/` trees, fetched upstream source, overlays, and third-party
material are outside this BSD-2-Clause scope and retain their own provenance
and licenses.
